make an attack upon the Old Testament, watch out. It\u2019s like the man at the insane asylum who was digging at the foundation, and a man came by and said to him, \u201cWhat are you doing?\u201d He said, \u201cWell, I\u2019m digging up the foundation.\u201d \u201cWhy?\u201d he said. \u201cYou live in that building.\u201d He says, \u201cI know, but I live upstairs.\u201d And I\u2019m afraid that a great many people say, \u201cI live in the New Testament.\u201d But, my friends, the Old Testament is the foundation. Our Lord says, \u201cIf you believe not His writings, how shall you believe my words?\u201d They both go together.\n\nhttps://www.oneplace.com/ministries/thru-the-bible-sunday-sermon/listen/an-old-portrait-of-christ-1299109.html?ref=sc\n\nhttps://ttb.org/\n\n...Daily Promises...\n\nThy word [is] true [from] the beginning: and every one of thy righteous judgments [endureth] for ever. (Psalm 119:160)\n\nNever doubt, O people of the Lord, the veracity of His word for it bears His own mark and will ever reveal His plan for your redemption. Every assurance is granted you in His word and can be relied upon without fail! Rejoice in His abounding grace and unceasing truth! He is the way. He is the truth. He is your life. And He is your very soul's blood! Rejoice in Him! Sing, \"Hallelujah!\" and praise His name forever!\n\nhttps://www.blueletterbible.org/devotionals/promises/view.cfm\n\n...Who Is Jesus? Islam...\n\n\u201cWhosoever shall confess that Jesus is the Son of God, God dwelleth in him, and he in God.\u201d \u2014 1 John 4:15\n\nAdmiring Jesus Is Not the Same as Trusting Him\n\nhttps://digginganotherwell.substack.com/p/who-is-jesus-islam\n\n...Faith Plus Nothing Equals Salvation...\n\nhttps://youtu.be/fDR0mu18x80?si=VuXS8_GiSianxV7D\n\nhttps://blueletterbible.org/Comm/mcgee_j_vernon/eBooks/faith-plus-zero-equals-salvation.cfm\n \n\u201cThe sin underneath all our sins is to trust the lie of the serpent that we cannot trust the love and grace of Christ and must take matters into our own hands\u201d - Martin Luther\n\nWhat can you ever really know of other people\u2019s souls\u2014of their temptations, their opportunities, their struggles? One soul in the whole of creation you do know: and it is the only one whose fate is placed in your hands. If there is a God, you are, in a sense, alone with him.  - C. S. Lewis\n\nHead Up\n\nEyes Forward\n\nHold The Line Patriots\n\nKeep Calm\n\nAnd\n\nHowl On\n", "author": "ashlanddog", "created": 1794792494622, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "ashlanddog", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "...No Jesus, No Peace...Know Jesus, Know Peace...", "last_comment_created": 1794800202075, "content": "<p>...No Jesus, No Peace...Know Jesus, Know Peace...</p>\n<p>\u201cThese things I have spoken to you, that My joy may remain in you, and that your joy may be full.\u201d \u2014John 15:11</p>\n<p>...Thru the Bible - Sunday Sermon  Dr. J. Vernon McGee...</p>\n<p>Picture albums are great for capturing moments in time that tell a story or reveal the personality of a person. God has His own picture album\u2014it\u2019s the Old Testament. In it, He reveals the person and work of Christ long before He came to this earth in human form.</p>\n<p>References: Leviticus 1:1-10</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.oneplace.com/ministries/thru-the-bible-questions-and-answers/listen/questions-answers-3083-1299108.html?ref=sc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.oneplace.com/ministries/thru-the-bible-questions-and-answers/listen/questions-answers-3083-1299108.html?ref=sc</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://ttb.org/\" target=\"_blank\">https://ttb.org/</a></p>\n<p>...Thru the Bible - Minute with McGee Dr. J. Vernon McGee...</p>\n<p>Old Testament is the foundation</p>\n<p>When a man begins to make an attack upon the Old Testament, watch out. It\u2019s like the man at the insane asylum who was digging at the foundation, and a man came by and said to him, \u201cWhat are you doing?\u201d He said, \u201cWell, I\u2019m digging up the foundation.\u201d \u201cWhy?\u201d he said. \u201cYou live in that building.\u201d He says, \u201cI know, but I live upstairs.\u201d And I\u2019m afraid that a great many people say, \u201cI live in the New Testament.\u201d But, my friends, the Old Testament is the foundation. Our Lord says, \u201cIf you believe not His writings, how shall you believe my words?\u201d They both go together.</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.oneplace.com/ministries/thru-the-bible-sunday-sermon/listen/an-old-portrait-of-christ-1299109.html?ref=sc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.oneplace.com/ministries/thru-the-bible-sunday-sermon/listen/an-old-portrait-of-christ-1299109.html?ref=sc</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://ttb.org/\" target=\"_blank\">https://ttb.org/</a></p>\n<p>...Daily Promises...</p>\n<p>Thy word [is] true [from] the beginning: and every one of thy righteous judgments [endureth] for ever. (Psalm 119:160)</p>\n<p>Never doubt, O people of the Lord, the veracity of His word for it bears His own mark and will ever reveal His plan for your redemption. Every assurance is granted you in His word and can be relied upon without fail! Rejoice in His abounding grace and unceasing truth! He is the way. He is the truth. He is your life. And He is your very soul's blood! Rejoice in Him! Sing, &quot;Hallelujah!&quot; and praise His name forever!</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.blueletterbible.org/devotionals/promises/view.cfm\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.blueletterbible.org/devotionals/promises/view.cfm</a></p>\n<p>...Who Is Jesus? Islam...</p>\n<p>\u201cWhosoever shall confess that Jesus is the Son of God, God dwelleth in him, and he in God.\u201d \u2014 1 John 4:15</p>\n<p>Admiring Jesus Is Not the Same as Trusting Him</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://digginganotherwell.substack.com/p/who-is-jesus-islam\" target=\"_blank\">https://digginganotherwell.substack.com/p/who-is-jesus-islam</a></p>\n<p>...Faith Plus Nothing Equals Salvation...</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fDR0mu18x80?si=VuXS8_GiSianxV7D\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/fDR0mu18x80?si=VuXS8_GiSianxV7D</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://blueletterbible.org/Comm/mcgee_j_vernon/eBooks/faith-plus-zero-equals-salvation.cfm\" target=\"_blank\">https://blueletterbible.org/Comm/mcgee_j_vernon/eBooks/faith-plus-zero-equals-salvation.cfm</a></p>\n<p>\u201cThe sin underneath all our sins is to trust the lie of the serpent that we cannot trust the love and grace of Christ and must take matters into our own hands\u201d - Martin Luther</p>\n<p>What can you ever really know of other people\u2019s souls\u2014of their temptations, their opportunities, their struggles? One soul in the whole of creation you do know: and it is the only one whose fate is placed in your hands. If there is a God, you are, in a sense, alone with him.  - C. S. Lewis</p>\n<p>Head Up</p>\n<p>Eyes Forward</p>\n<p>Hold The Line Patriots</p>\n<p>Keep Calm</p>\n<p>And</p>\n<p>Howl On</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 28, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiIchs6", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 27, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8941656, "raw_content": "", "author": "Mount_10_ear", "created": 1794793216703, "profile_picture": "iH